00:08:32.745 --> 00:08:34.780
And the "Forged in
Fire" Champion is--

00:08:39.452 --> 00:08:40.219
Josh.

00:08:40.286 --> 00:08:41.086
 Holy [bleep].

00:08:41.153 --> 00:08:42.421
HOST: Congratulations.

00:08:42.488 --> 00:08:44.824
Brad, unfortunately, you're not
going home with the win today.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.191
