00:08:58.371 --> 00:08:59.205
 I understand.

00:08:59.238 --> 00:08:59.972
Have a good one, guys.

00:09:00.039 --> 00:09:00.606
 Pleasure, man.

00:09:00.639 --> 00:09:01.874
 Thank you.

