00:09:28.667 --> 00:09:29.801
I won this--

00:09:29.868 --> 00:09:30.502
I won.

00:09:30.569 --> 00:09:31.537
It's a little overwhelming.

00:09:31.603 --> 00:09:32.972
I can't wait to tell my wife.

00:09:33.039 --> 00:09:34.807
She had a lot of confidence
